<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (Existing petition and complaint management systems are manual, inefficient, and lack a centralized platform for submitting requests with documents like PDFs or audio. Users face difficulties in tracking status, while administrators struggle to handle large volumes due to lack of automation, intelligent classification, and priority-based handling, where critical issues \(e.g., healthcare\) should be addressed before less urgent ones \(e.g., street lighting\). These systems also lack secure authentication, real-time notifications, data-driven insights, and efficient background processing, leading to delays, mismanagement, reduced transparency, poor decision-making, and ultimately low user satisfaction and operational inefficiencies.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
